WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:08.120
What's with you?!

3
00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:10.590
Would you stop this
nonsense already?!

4
00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:12.420
Usopp just got worked up

5
00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:15.090
because things were
moving too fast, right?

6
00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:17.100
That's no reason to
fight with your own friend,

7
00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:18.700
especially when he's hurt!

8
00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:19.760
If you give it some time,

9
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.670
I'm sure both of you will
see how silly this is.

10
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.210
We've gone too far
to turn back now.

11
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.170
That's not true!

12
00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.180
There's nothing stopping
you from apologizing

13
00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.610
and talking it
over one more time!

14
00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:37.110
Like I said, no turning back.

15
00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.980
And why not?

16
00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:41.850
Usopp is willing to risk his life to fight
me.

17
00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:43.910
He's more than just angry.

18
00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:47.280
Besides, if just talking it over
was enough to make things right,

19
00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:50.790
we wouldn'ta come to
this in the first place.

20
00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:53.130
That's all I have to say, so goodnight.

21
00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:55.600
Luffy...

22
00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:57.730
[SANJI]
Think about it!

23
00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:00.860
You said the Franky Family
came here this afternoon, right?

24
00:01:01.090 --> 00:01:03.360
Yeah? So, what are
you trying to say?

25
00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:05.030
If you hadn't let
them off so easy,

26
00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:06.300
they would've have
stolen the money

27
00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:07.530
from us in the first place!

28
00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.600
It's your fault those
guys attacked Usopp!

29
00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:12.000
He's just freaking out
'cause he feels guilty!

30
00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:15.140
Hey! Don't go blaming me for not
kicking their asses hard enough,

31
00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:17.130
you were the one who
ran off to go shopping!

32
00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:19.430
What am I 'sposed to cook
if I don't have any food?!

33
00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.050
[NAMI]
Both of you shut up!

34
00:01:21.050 --> 00:01:21.980
Huh?

35
00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:24.520
[NAMI]
There's been
enough fighting already.

36
00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:27.950
[NAMI]
Whatever
happened, it's over now.

37
00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:31.790
I know but this wouldn't be
happening if it wasn't for him!

38
00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:37.200
Oh, hey. You're back.

39
00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.530
You were going after Usopp, weren't you?

40
00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:45.170
Even if he was mad, I still wanted to
treat his wounds.

41
00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:47.530
But he turned me away.

42
00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:48.830
He found a place to stay.

43
00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:51.570
So at least he
can get some rest.

44
00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:54.040
But do you know what he said to me?

45
00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:55.930
He said we
aren't friends now.

46
00:01:55.970 --> 00:02:00.370
So I should leave him alone
and go back to the ship.

47
00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:08.180
Just this morning we were
all so happy and now what?

48
00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:13.390
[NAMI]
We lost Usopp.

49
00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:15.220
Robin's still missing.

50
00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:18.560
I feel like if we
don't do something...

51
00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:21.490
...the whole crew
is gonna fall apart.

52
00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:28.610
[LUFFY]
It's 10 o'clock.

53
00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:31.080
Usopp'll be here
any second now.

54
00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:43.760
Listen up! I don't want
any of you leaving the ship!

55
00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:45.030
You got that?

56
00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:52.470
Look!

57
00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.740
Please don't fight!

58
00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:20.330
So you didn't lose your nerve after all.

59
00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:22.970
No matter how this battle ends,
you can't regret it.

60
00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.670
This is exactly what you asked for.

61
00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:28.670
That's perfect.
Don't go easy on me.

62
00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:30.710
I won't be the underdog this time.

63
00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:34.360
In fact. I've already figured
out a way to defeat you.

64
00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:38.570
Shouldn't we stop this?
Usopp's injuries are pretty bad!

65
00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:41.390
If you can't stand to watch, then go
inside.

66
00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:42.620
[LUFFY]
Make no mistake,

67
00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.960
I'm not like any opponent
you've faced before.

68
00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:47.860
We've been friends a long time.

69
00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:50.730
I know all your powers,
all your strengths,

70
00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:52.670
and all of your weaknesses!

71
00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.610
But there's something you don't know about
me.

72
00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:51.280
I have 8 thousand
men on my side!

73
00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:55.220
If you don't surrender now,
I'll order them to attack!

74
00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.950
What?! Why didn't
he tell me?!

75
00:05:57.990 --> 00:05:59.860
Seriously, just go inside.

76
00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:02.890
If you're gonna fight, then
at least take this seriously!

77
00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:05.390
Usopp Voodoo!

78
00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:09.010
You have razor-sharp needles
stuck between all of your teeth!

79
00:06:09.690 --> 00:06:12.000
[CHOPPER]
Ahh!
It hurts just to imagine that!

80
00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:13.420
[ZORO]
I'm telling you, go inside.

81
00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:15.330
You've got
prickly cactus spines.

82
00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:16.990
Under your finger...

83
00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:21.930
Gum-Gum Pistol!

84
00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:27.860
What happened?

85
00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:33.710
Waaaaah!
Usopp, please don't die!

86
00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:36.710
Special Attack
Ketchup Star!

87
00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:39.020
Pity for your enemy?

88
00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:42.060
That's awful arrogant,
don't you think?

89
00:06:42.090 --> 00:06:43.060
Flash Dial!

90
00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:51.200
Now Special Attack: Egg Star!

91
00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:54.000
Again! Again!

92
00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.500
Again!

93
00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:59.690
It stinks! They're rotten!

94
00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.110
Damn it! Would you stop
messing around already?!

95
00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:04.990
[USOPP]
You think this is a joke, huh?

96
00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:06.180
Cause I'm dead serious!

97
00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:07.010
Oh yeah?

98
00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:09.240
That's right!
This is the way I fight!

99
00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:12.240
Careful, that gaping mouth
of yours is gonna get burned!

100
00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:19.290
Special Attack Tabasco Star!

101
00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:22.220
[LUFFY]
Hot!

102
00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:24.360
[USOPP]
I wouldn't jump around
too much if I were you!

103
00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:27.460
'Cause the whole
battlefield is Caltrop Hell!

104
00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.260
Ow!

105
00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.230
He's controlling the fight!

106
00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:37.570
Listen, Luffy.
You can pity me if you want,

107
00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:40.020
<b>Luffy vs. Usopp</b>

108
00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:40.170
but I'm gonna beat you
and take the Merry with me!

109
00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:42.580
And I don't care what it takes!

110
00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:45.510
[USOPP]
Special Attack! Pepper Star!

111
00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:49.240
[sneezes]

112
00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:55.320
[sneezes]

113
00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.280
Like I said, I know you.

114
00:07:57.320 --> 00:08:00.120
So I know which attacks
are gonna work the best!

115
00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:06.980
[LUFFY]
Damn it. This stuff stinks.

116
00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:09.450
My mouth is burning.

117
00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:10.450
And it hurts!

118
00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:12.550
I'm not gonna give you
an inch, you hear me?

119
00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:16.090
Special Attack
Shuriken Shooting Stars!

120
00:08:58.680 --> 00:08:59.600
Smoke?

121
00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.380
[USOPP]
I'm using a Breath Dial.

122
00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:09.650
You didn't notice the smell because of the
rotten eggs.

123
00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:17.030
And now you're completely surrounded by
gas.

124
00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:18.470
Gas?

125
00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:20.270
Don't tell me, he...

126
00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:22.240
Sorry.

127
00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:25.110
Flame Star!

128
00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:38.720
That one's gonna sting!

129
00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:47.690
Luffy! Usopp!

130
00:09:58.210 --> 00:09:59.110
[USOPP]
I am Usopp...

131
00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:00.880
Leader of the invincible
nation of pirates

132
00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.230
who reign over this island!

133
00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:05.970
You stand before
a living legend,

134
00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.070
the most revered
pirate who ever lived!

135
00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:10.300
I am the great Captain Usopp!

136
00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:20.550
[LUFFY]
Hahahahahah!
That's pretty cool!

137
00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:23.250
Shut your mouth,
or I'll shut it for you!

138
00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:24.560
[LUFFY]
How come?!

139
00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:27.180
We're friends, right? So get on.

140
00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:33.300
[USOPP]
Hey! I see an island!

141
00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:37.240
[LUFFY]
Awesome! I can't
wait to check it out!

142
00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:42.480
[LUFFY]
All right, let's go!
Merry, full speed ahead!

143
00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:44.950
[USOPP]
Full speed ahead!

144
00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:17.220
I can't take this anymore.

145
00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:20.420
Luffy! Usopp!

146
00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:38.620
I'm no fool.

147
00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:41.650
I realize it'll take more than that to
beat you.

148
00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.590
I know you, Luffy.

149
00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:49.580
You fight every battle with all your
strength.

150
00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:52.120
But I'm ready for any technique you've
got!

151
00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:57.930
Special Attack...

152
00:11:57.960 --> 00:12:01.660
Gum-Gum Gatling!

153
00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:02.960
...Blasting...

154
00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.870
...Cactus Stars!

155
00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:16.510
Triple Exploding Stars!

156
00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:34.600
Gum-Gum Pistol!

157
00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:42.830
It's time to put an end to this!

158
00:12:57.240 --> 00:12:58.770
Recognize this?

159
00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:02.740
I bet that bazooka would've
hurt. Let's find out!

160
00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:04.940
Impact!

161
00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:10.820
Waaaaaah!

162
00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:14.090
He used an Impact Dial!

163
00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:17.160
Auuuugh!

164
00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:23.700
I won't lose to you!

165
00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:54.690
I am Usopp, Leader of the
invincible nation of pirates

166
00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:56.900
who reign over this island!

167
00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:05.650
[LUFFY]
Cheers to a new
ship and a new crewmate!

168
00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:09.380
[cheers]

169
00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:12.010
[USOPP]
So? How do you like this one?

170
00:14:12.190 --> 00:14:14.530
[LUFFY]
Yeah! Keep it! That's the one!

171
00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:16.210
Okay! It's all done!

172
00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:17.970
Now the Going Merry

173
00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:21.170
has everything she
could possibly need!

174
00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:28.330
[LUFFY]
Gum-Gum Bullet!

175
00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:39.770
Usopp!

176
00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:09.390
At least it's over now.

177
00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:27.380
[LUFFY]
You idiot.

178
00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:29.850
You knew it would end like this!

179
00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:32.460
You knew you could never beat me!

180
00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:01.950
[NAMI]
Why did this have to happen?

181
00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:13.780
[LUFFY]
Do whatever you
want with the Merry.

182
00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:19.840
I won't let anything
hold us back.

183
00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:24.350
We're getting a new ship
and sailing forward.

184
00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:26.280
Hey, let me sit up there!

185
00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:29.220
Sorry Usopp, but this seat's
reserved for the captain.

186
00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:33.160
Oh! What're you making?
Lemme see, lemme see!

187
00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:35.190
Hold on, the Usopp
Factory is off limits

188
00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:37.060
'til I finish this for Nami.

189
00:16:47.490 --> 00:16:51.460
[USOPP]
Guys, listen up!
I will go to Elbaf someday!

190
00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:53.630
To the village of warriors!

191
00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:57.300
[LUFFY]
Yeah! Great!

192
00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:01.300
[USOPP]
It's the festival on
the night before gold hunting!

193
00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:18.480
[LUFFY]
So long, Usopp.
It was fun while it lasted.

194
00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:24.960
[SANJI]
Chopper! Leave him alone!

195
00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:26.890
What are you saying?!

196
00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:28.830
He was already hurt before the fight!

197
00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:31.400
If I don't help him,
who knows what'll happen!

198
00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:33.340
[SANJI]
He isn't part
of our crew anymore!

199
00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.740
[CHOPPER]
So what?! I'm a doctor!

200
00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:39.200
It's my job to treat him!

201
00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:45.620
It's bad enough
that he lost the duel;

202
00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:47.220
if you pity him
at a time like this,

203
00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:52.390
you'll end up hurting him
more than any of those injuries.

204
00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:54.340
[SANJI]
I'm sure you
have good intentions.

205
00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:58.170
But all we can do now is
give him dignity in defeat.

206
00:17:58.290 --> 00:18:01.190
He knew that when he
challenged Luffy to a duel,

207
00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:03.200
this is how it might end.

208
00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:16.350
It's too much.

209
00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:19.620
This is what it means to be captain.

210
00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:25.130
You can't doubt yourself.

211
00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:29.270
In times like these if
you lose your confidence

212
00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:31.510
then who can we
have faith in?

213
00:18:43.150 --> 00:18:45.090
Let's pack our things and go.

214
00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:59.100
[ZORO]
You know as well
as me that after tonight

215
00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:02.070
we can never return
to this ship again.
